  <Docs>
    <summary>Class providing the position range of a text match information.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Class providing the position range of a text match information.</para>
      <para>All ranges are finite, and the left side of the range is always <c>&lt;=</c> the right side
            of the range.</para>
      <para>Example: MatchRange(0, 100) represents hundred ints from 0 to 99."</para>
      <para>
        <format type="text/html">
          <a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/appsearch/SearchResult.MatchRange" title="Reference documentation">Java documentation for <code>android.app.appsearch.SearchResult.MatchRange</code>.</a>
        </format>
      </para>
