        <summary>Creates a new immutable range.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>Creates a new immutable range.</para>
          <para>The endpoints are <c>[start, end)</c>; that is the range is bounded. <c>start</c>
            must be lesser or equal to <c>end</c>.</para>
